    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Video games have become increasingly popular in the last decade. More and more people of different ages are playing games from a wide variety of genres. Though game graphics have been improving remarkably thanks to leaps in technology, there is another element to video games that many overlook: game audio. This podcast aims to shed light on the importance of game audio in video games, and to illustrate that perhaps game sounds might be more impactful than people give them credit for. By examining the worth of game sounds through technical and emotional lenses, this podcast also suggests that perhaps game audio can be labeled as something more: as art.",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
